{"s":[[null,1,[["p",["Ginger Ale is a ",["l","烹饪","cooked"]," drink. It is prepared using either the kitchen inside an upgraded ",["l","农舍","farmhouse"]," or a ",["l","野炊工具","Cookout Kit"],"."]],["p",["When consumed, it grants the player +1 ",["l","运气","luck"]," for 5m. As a drink, its ",["l","效果","buff"]," stacks with any food buffs (including Speed), but replaces any other drink buffs (i.e., from ",["l","咖啡","Coffee"]," or ",["l","绿茶","Green Tea"],")."]]]],["Gifting",2,[["t",[[{"h":1,"v":["Love"]},[["l","文森特","Vincent"]]],[{"h":1,"v":["Like"]},[["l","罗宾","Robin"],", ",["l","玛鲁","Maru"],", ",["l","塞巴斯蒂安","Sebastian"],", ",["l","莱纳斯","Linus"],", ",["l","皮埃尔","Pierre"],", ",["l","卡洛琳","Caroline"],", ",["l","阿比盖尔","Abigail"],", ",["l","亚历克斯","Alex"],", ",["l","乔治","George"],", ",["l","艾芙琳","Evelyn"],", ",["l","刘易斯","Lewis"],", ",["l","克林特","Clint"],", ",["l","潘妮","Penny"],", ",["l","潘姆","Pam"],", ",["l","艾米丽","Emily"],", ",["l","海莉","Haley"],", ",["l","贾斯","Jas"],", ",["l","乔迪","Jodi"],", ",["l","肯特","Kent"],", ",["l","山姆","Sam"],", ",["l","莉亚","Leah"],", ",["l","谢恩","Shane"],", ",["l","玛妮","Marnie"],", ",["l","艾利欧特","Elliott"],", ",["l","格斯","Gus"],", ",["l","矮人","Dwarf"],", ",["l","法师","Wizard"],", ",["l","哈维","Harvey"],", ",["l","桑迪","Sandy"],", ",["l","德米特里厄斯","Demetrius"]]],[{"h":1,"v":["Dislike"]},[["l","威利","Willy"],", ",["l","科罗布斯","Krobus"],", ",["l","雷欧","Leo"]]]]]]],["Tailoring",2,[["p",["Ginger Ale is used in the spool of the ",["l","柳巷2号","Sewing Machine"]," to create the ",["l","裁缝","Ginger Overalls"],". ",["f","Ginger_Overalls.png",24]," It can be used in ",["l","染色","dyeing"],", serving as a green dye at the dye pots, located in ",["l","艾米丽","Emily"],"'s and ",["l","海莉","Haley"],"'s house, ",["l","柳巷2号","2 Willow Lane"],"."]]]],["Notes",2,[["l",0,[[1,["Ginger and ginger ale are common remedies for nausea. Though it is not specifically noted in-game, eating ",["l","姜","Ginger"]," or drinking Ginger Ale cures the ",["l","效果","Nauseated debuff"],". This i